sub run | Run one program; output passes through live and the exit cod
sub eval | Evaluate a snippet in a fresh session and print its value as
sub check | Check files through the frontend only (lex, parse, resolve)
sub corpus | Walk the pinned corpus and check every directive against thi
sub conformance | Export the versioned conformance bundle, or check an impleme
sub conform-run | Observe one program and emit a spec/06 observation record
sub lex | Tokenize one program (`spec/01` §1)
sub parse | Parse one program (`spec/01` §2-§6)
sub protocol | Validate observation records against the spec/06 schema
sub diff-run | Compare this implementation against the pinned compiler, cor
sub fuzz | Differential testing over generated programs, with reduction
sub repl | Interactive session; `--script` replays a recorded transcrip
sub help | Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
flag -e arg=none | Evaluate CODE in a fresh session and print its value as the
flag -h --help | Print help (see a summary with '-h')
flag -V --version | Print version
